    "type": "spr",
    "stem": "<figure class=\"table\"><table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: center;\" scope=\"col\">Shape</th>\n<th style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\" scope=\"col\">Number of cards</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Square</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Circle</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Triangle</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.6236%; text-align: left;\">Star</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.7844%; text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The table summarizes the distribution of shape printed on one side for cards in a deck of cards. How many cards in the deck have a triangle printed on one side?</p>",
